<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Orion opposes Sons Gwalia bid.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Orion opposes Sons Gwalia bid.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gold miner Orion Resources NL said on Friday an independent report had concluded that the takeover bid by Sons of Gwalia Ltd was neither fair nor reasonable.</p>
<p>Orion said its directors would recommend that shareholders reject the conditional A$1.80 per share offer, noting that the report valued Orion shares between A$1.92 to A$2.14 each.</p>
</text>
